### 创建产品
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products
Authorization: Basic victor 123456
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "一次性丁腈手套",
  "udiDi": "6979510980000"
}

### 查询产品列表
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products

### 查询产品
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products/01a1349c-4b07-726a-9940-e0b7570efa16

### 修改产品
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products/01a1349c-4b07-726a-9940-e0b7570efa16
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "一次性丁腈手套2",
  "udiDi": "6979510980002"
}

### 停用产品
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/v1/products/01a1349c-4b07-726a-9940-e0b7570efa16